      "title": {
        "en": "Batch Doctor",
        "zh": "脚本体检"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Lints and fixes Windows scripts: UTF-8 Chinese bat files that break cmd, missing BOM on ps1, chcp/encoding mismatch, LF endings, naked parentheses, hard-coded stale paths. Only touches .bat/.cmd/.ps1 in the given folder; .bak before writes.",
        "zh": "检查/修复 Windows 脚本：中文 bat 存成 UTF-8 导致 cmd 串行、ps1 缺 BOM、chcp 与编码不匹配、LF 行尾、块内裸括号、写死老路径。只动指定目录里的 .bat/.cmd/.ps1，写前 .bak。"
      },
